TITLE("UiGallery")
TOPIC_TEXT(
"UiGallery is the model-backed, fluid wrapping item view for large visual collections. "
"It uses uniform cell geometry by default so scrolling, hit testing and painting remain "
"bounded by the viewport rather than total model size. Bind UiListModel with SetModel(), "
"configure SetItemSize(), SetGap() and SetInset(), and use WhenVisibleRange for lazy asset "
"preparation outside Paint(). WhenPaintItem can replace the render-only tile painter."
)
